# The rendered HLD, the DOCX and the diagrams are binaries. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, and a checkout that "fixes" line endings in
# these would silently produce an unopenable PDF. Nothing here enables
# text=auto, so no existing text file is renormalized.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
